":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PRpjxJNfK0I_em5CNLYpVA","review_id":"MQwsDNaRAc2ZZQID52FMQA","date":"2014-03-27T01:39:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9165621995925903,"text_excerpt":"I know what you are thinking, and yes I am giving Applebee's 5 stars. When the boyfriend and I started discussing our mutual love for burgers, I lamented that there just isn't a good burger place on the Westbank. That's when he suggested Applebee's. At first I was skeptical. I mean, come on, how good can an Applebee's burger be? But, he has proven to be a \"tough sell\" when it comes to food, so I figured that he must know what he's talking about. We stopped in and of course, immediately knew that we wanted burgers. We both decided on the bacon cheddar cheeseburger. I really like that the waitress asked how we wanted it cooked and when we said \"medium\" she asked if we wanted pink in the mid..."},{"business_id":"PRpjxJNfK0I_em5CNLYpVA","review_id":"-uCuhwKYNc4JohpvT1sVlw","date":"2018-04-09T13:50:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9084045886993408,"text_excerpt":"Applebee's can be good. Who would have thought this? Now, don't get me wrong, I am not going all \"Chain Food\" on you. But for a quick meal with the family, this was good. If you are short on time, and looking for a bite, give this place a try. Service was friendly, food was fast and good. All around a pleasant experience."},{"business_id":"PRpjxJNfK0I_em5CNLYpVA","review_id":"K4itQ53yCtHQq_PuWooceA","date":"2018-08-12T19:27:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9072118401527405,"text_excerpt":"Now that my friends was Customer Service. From the moment we walked in the door until we left we felt appreciated and well taken care of. Kendra met us at the door with a greeting and a smile. Our orders were taken by Dana promptly and she was excellent. I even had conversations with the GM as well as the Manager (Dale). I'm blown away by the service. The Grilled Chicken sandwich with cheese and Bacon was very good. the Ribs were also very good. They even brought us a taste of the Brisket that they sell. Needless to say I'll be back, as soon as possible. Be sure to see Dana for New Orleans style hospitality."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PRpjxJNfK0I_em5CNLYpVA","photo_id":"5Jnd3NhvHc-HxYXqh6A8rg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/5Jnd3NhvHc-HxYXqh6A8rg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9184178113937378},{"business_id":"PRpjxJNfK0I_em5CNLYpVA","photo_id":"6zwOYOJXYs47seFetnOCsg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6zwOYOJXYs47seFetnOCsg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9092364311218262},{"business_id":"PRpjxJNfK0I_em5CNLYpVA"